WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.302
[grand orchestral music]

00:00:03.335 --> 00:00:05.638
- HELLO, MY FELLOW AMERICANS.

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:08.641
WITH ME, AS ALWAYS,
IS MY ANGER TRANSLATOR, LUTHER.

00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:10.176
- HI!

00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:11.711
- NOW, THE FIRST YEAR
OF MY SECOND TERM

00:00:11.744 --> 00:00:12.779
HAS BEEN A CHALLENGE.

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:15.381
- CLUSTER....[bleep]!

00:00:15.414 --> 00:00:17.750
- TONIGHT, I'D LIKE
TO ADDRESS THE CONCERNS

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:20.186
OF THE AMERICAN PEOPLE
OVER WHAT THEY PERCEIVE

00:00:20.219 --> 00:00:22.588
AS THE U.S. GOVERNMENT SPYING
ON THEIR DIGITAL

00:00:22.621 --> 00:00:24.490
AND ELECTRONIC ACTIVITIES.

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:27.493
- MAN, Y'ALL SOME DELUDED,
SELF-IMPORTANT MOTHER[bleep]

00:00:27.526 --> 00:00:29.395
IF YOU THINK WE INTERESTED
IN YOUR DEVIANT,

00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:31.230
PORN-WATCHIN' ASSES!

00:00:31.263 --> 00:00:33.699
- I CAN ASSURE YOU,
THE AMERICAN PEOPLE,

00:00:33.732 --> 00:00:36.135
WE ARE NOT READING
EVERY INDIVIDUAL EMAIL.

00:00:36.168 --> 00:00:38.204
RATHER, WE'RE SEARCHING
FOR KEY WORDS

00:00:38.237 --> 00:00:39.739
THAT WOULD INDICATE A THREAT.

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:41.240
- AND DON'T WORRY,
EVERYBODY,

00:00:41.273 --> 00:00:43.543
THOSE KEY WORDS ARE NOT
"GIRL ON GIRL,"

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:46.679
ANAL, SQUIRTING,
PLOPPING.

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:49.148
- HMM. "PLOPPING"?

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:50.516
- WHAT THE [bleep]
IS "PLOPPING,"

00:00:50.549 --> 00:00:51.818
YOU DIRTY MOTHER[bleep]?

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:53.820
- THESE KEY WORDS
ARE BEING USED,

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:54.821
AMONGST OTHER THINGS,

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:56.222
TO PREVENT TERRORISTS

00:00:56.255 --> 00:00:58.458
FROM USING WEAPONS
OF MASS DESTRUCTION.

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:00.460
- NOT PREVENT YOU
FROM WATCHING VIDEOS

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:02.528
OF ASS DESTRUCTION!

00:01:02.561 --> 00:01:04.831
- NOW, THESE POLICIES
HAVE ALREADY FOILED

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:07.300
NUMEROUS TERRORIST PLOTS.

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:09.102
- THESE ARE NOT THE KIND OF
PLOTS THAT Y'ALL ARE USED TO,

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:10.403
LIKE WHEN A GUY
COMES IN THE DOOR

00:01:10.436 --> 00:01:11.704
WITH HIS PENIS
IN A PIZZA BOX,

00:01:11.737 --> 00:01:13.339
AND LADY SUCKS ON IT.

00:01:13.372 --> 00:01:14.841
- AND I ASSURE YOU

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:16.442
THAT THE COUNTRY'S
GOTTEN SAFER

00:01:16.475 --> 00:01:18.311
SINCE THE END
OF THE BUSH ERA.

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:20.413
- AND I AIN'T TALKIN'
ABOUT THE PRESIDENT. BOOP.

00:01:20.446 --> 00:01:23.883
- THESE POLICIES HAVE ALLOWED US
TO PROBE AND PENETRATE...

00:01:23.916 --> 00:01:25.885
- I KNOW Y'ALL BEEN PROBIN--
- UNTIL THE DE--NO, LUTHER...

00:01:25.918 --> 00:01:28.254
JUST, WHAT I'M
TRYING TO SAY IS

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:30.857
THAT THERE HAVE BEEN NUMEROUS
TERRORIST CELLS FINGERED--

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:32.325
- AND YOU GOT FINGERS, YOU PUT--
- AND THAT--LUTHER.

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:33.860
- OKAY. LUTHER,
WHY ARE YOU TRYING

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:36.229
TO UNDERMINE THE PRESIDENT
WITH YOUR JUVENILE

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:37.797
SEXUAL INNUENDO?

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:40.133
- THE AVERAGE AMERICAN
HAS NOTHING TO FEAR

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:41.334
FROM THESE POLICIES.

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:43.736
- NOW! IF WE WAS
DRONE-STRIKIN' PERVERTS,

00:01:43.769 --> 00:01:45.204
OUR COUNTRY WOULD LOOK LIKE

00:01:45.237 --> 00:01:47.440
<i> MAD MAX: BEYOND THUNDERDOME</i>
RIGHT ABOUT NOW.

00:01:47.473 --> 00:01:50.543
I'M TALKIN' ABOUT
A POST-APOCALYPTIC NIGHTMARE!

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:51.811
- THANK YOU,
AND GOOD NIGHT.

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:53.179
- GO TO SLEEP, Y'ALL.

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:55.815
- "PLOPPING"?
- OH, YES, SIR.

00:01:55.848 --> 00:01:57.517
THAT'S WHEN...

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.652
- OH!

00:01:59.685 --> 00:02:01.885
Y'ALL ARE SOME SICK
MOTHER[bleep].

